The bug is in file https://github.com/sonic-net/sonic-buildimage/blob/master/dockers/docker-router-advertiser/radvd.conf.j2

12  {% if VLAN_INTERFACE %}
13  {% set vlan_list = dict() %}

The set statement to init vlan_list should be before if check. The current code fails at 
27  {% for name, prefixes in vlan_list.items() %}

when line 12 is false because vlan_list is never declared.

